WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.500
[Mappe logo]
Mappe, personal product, 2026. My job search needed a product.

00:04.500 --> 00:09.500
The problem: applications in a sheet, replies in Gmail, PDFs in folders.

00:09.500 --> 00:12.100
Dashboard: summary first, then the list.

00:12.100 --> 00:24.367
Dashboard, with demo data: the summary comes first. A late follow-up has its own buttons, and the list filters by status in one tap.
[Interface in Portuguese.]

00:24.367 --> 00:31.067
One sheet per application: status, next step and timeline. Changing the status is one click.

00:31.067 --> 00:33.667
Daily search: a search every morning.

00:33.667 --> 00:39.700
Jobs: Claude searches every morning and drops new jobs in an inbox. I decide to apply or discard.

00:39.700 --> 00:44.700
On the phone: the same system, in my pocket.

00:44.700 --> 00:50.200
Under the hood: 1 job search by Claude every day, 3 inbox checks for replies a day, 16 automated tests on every push.

00:50.200 --> 00:54.200
Designed, built and used by me. React, TypeScript, Supabase.
